<title>UK: One Brent date clocked, another kept.</title>
<headline>One Brent date clocked, another kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the Dec 4-6 Brent dates which turned wet on Tuesday was clocked to Neste while the other was kept by traders J.P. Morgan, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian +44 171 542 4088</p>
